{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581940/extras/DV_Spot_The_Twist.png?t=1747298432\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deja View is a relaxing yet challenging spot-the-difference puzzle game, filled with surreal hand-drawn illustrations from Bleeding Moon Studio. Explore dream-like worlds as you uncover subtle differences hidden within beautiful artwork.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581940/extras/DV_Features.png?t=1747298432\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>16 surrealistic hand-drawn illustrations.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each illustration is split into <strong>two intricate halves</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find <strong>20 unique differences</strong> in each part\u2014<strong>40 per level</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn <strong>hints</strong> as you progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>achievements</strong> and discover <strong>captivating artwork descriptions</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a rich <strong>atmospheric soundtrack</strong> uniquely tailored to each illustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax with the <strong>Jukebox</strong>, where you can listen to the music tracks you've unlocked after completing levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">View completed illustrations in <strong>full view mode</strong> for the full artistic experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a beautifully crafted puzzle adventure that blends <strong>observation, relaxation, and creativity</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag